OL,3,ASerial rapist police officer passed
OL,4,Avetting despite warnings, BBC reveals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe revelation comes a month after
OL,7,FPolice Scotland told the BBC there had
OL,8,Fbeen no "missed opportunities over the
OL,9,Fyears" to identify Greer's offending
OL,10,Fsooner.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
